sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant CF as Cloudflare
    participant W as mitake-web
    participant M as mitake.py
    participant S as Mitake API
    participant A as Audit Log

    U->>CF: Access Request
    CF->>W: Forward Request
    W->>U: Display SMS Form
    U->>W: Submit SMS
    W->>M: Validate and Send SMS
    M->>S: SmSend API Call
    S-->>M: API Response
    M-->>W: Process Response
    W-->>U: Display Result
